---
// AboutFounder component for the About page
---

<section class="about-founder">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-content">
      <div class="founder-image">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <div class="placeholder-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M12 2L13.09 8.26L20 9L13.09 9.74L12 16L10.91 9.74L4 9L10.91 8.26L12 2Z" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="founder-text">
        <div class="founder-main">
          <h2 class="founder-title">Final Word from our Founder Katy</h2>
          <div class="founder-description">
            <p>Better bonnet trelawney fritters bright. Beans knickerbocker now twin moon fawkes sing. Chocolate train spectacles oddment wingardium aragog trevor revision chocolate woes.</p>
            
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            
            <p>House pig's lights from requirement peg-leg quaffle snitch potion. Frisbees quaffle harry knickerbocker telescope mrs parvati. Counter-clockwise tears banquet pie doxycide managed many stroke hiya.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/team" class="founder-cta">
            More About our Team
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="founder-signature">
          <div class="signature-content">
            <h3 class="signature-name">Katy Grace Kinney</h3>
            <p class="signature-title">FOUNDER, RESOLVED LAW GROUP</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-founder {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--dark-background) 0%, var(--secondary-background) 100%);
    padding: 96px 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--container-max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
  }

  .founder-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 244px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .founder-image {
    flex: 0 0 392px;
    height: 600px;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    background-color: var(--main-content);
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px 0px var(--dark-background);
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .placeholder-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--light-text);
  }

  .founder-text {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 604px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .founder-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--light-text);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founder-description {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--light-text);
  }

  .founder-description p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .founder-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--sunset);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--main-content);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .founder-cta:hover {
    background-color: var(--main-accent-light);
    color: var(--main-content);
  }

  .founder-signature {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .signature-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .signature-name {
    font-family: 'Cherolina', serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--main-accent-light);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .signature-title {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--main-accent-light);
    opacity: 0.6;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1440px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
    
    .founder-content {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .founder-title {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
    
    .signature-name {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founder-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .founder-image {
      flex: none;
      height: 300px;
    }
    
    .founder-title {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    
    .signature-name {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    
    .signature-content {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
